msgid ""
"Network between the headset and the ROS 2 machine (Wi-Fi, or **USB 网络共享** on"
" Pico Enterprise)"
msgstr "头显与 ROS 2 主机之间的网络（Wi-Fi，或 Pico 企业版上的 **USB 网络共享**）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:37
#: bbc1ff7bdaf949068ec959dedad29d0b
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:39
#: 5240e899b64d4a1fb5366c83095c23d9
msgid ""
"VR teleoperation publishes end-effector pose targets from VR controller "
"tracking. The MPC controller then generates joint trajectories to follow "
"these targets."
msgstr "VR 遥操作根据 VR 手柄追踪发布末端执行器位姿目标。随后由 MPC 控制器生成关节轨迹以跟随这些目标。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:41
#: 909812cbb7ed40a7b6d0f9fb632061cd
msgid ""
"How the arm **complies** with those poses depends on the robot. Two "
"different paths are used with VR teleop:"
msgstr "手臂如何**柔顺**跟踪这些位姿取决于机型。VR 遥操作使用两条不同路径："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: 3ff1251cdab443509babd9954aac536e
msgid "Path"
msgstr "路径"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: c04ea6e9ab99417c8e7f609d41dcab9c
msgid "Robots"
msgstr "机器人"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: 0cced4a1b6df4fcf8c8b1d4e4f778584
msgid "Who provides compliance"
msgstr "柔顺由谁提供"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: 74d3b792a35e43e5bb4563bee13d1eed
msgid "What the controller commands"
msgstr "控制器下发什么"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: ef34b3600f8d4c30a00be3ddfe1bf925
msgid "**MIT-mode force control**"
msgstr "**MIT 力控**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: 3b770130d1f347738c1e91621cafa196
msgid "**HighTorque** (高擎) **Panthera HT**; **ARX** (方舟无限) arms"
msgstr "**高擎 Panthera HT**；**方舟无限** 机械臂"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: e7ef636f0eed476b8d8a88f3f4b12fbf
msgid ""
"Controller + hardware interface in MIT / `full_control` (pos + vel + effort;"
" stiffness on the HI)"
msgstr "控制器 + 硬件接口走 MIT / `full_control`（位置 + 速度 + 力矩；刚度在 HI 上）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: 345d4dec07a14965ae560b2101e52b0f
msgid "Force-capable / MIX when the interfaces allow it"
msgstr "接口齐全时走带力控 / MIX"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: fed57656175a47baa5031e5f1fc1e96b
msgid "**Vendor joint impedance**"
msgstr "**厂商关节阻抗**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: 8acfaf357a2a49cd8553d1db3b7570eb
msgid "**Tianji** (天玑); **Rokae** (珞石)"
msgstr "**天玑**；**珞石**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: f632fb75aaec4967b8c54c93d9fd255b
msgid "Vendor stack, exposed on the hardware interface"
msgstr "厂商栈，经硬件接口暴露"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: b48445412cd04a69949bd0a9c1dc756c
msgid "**Position only**"
msgstr "**仅位置**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:48
#: b39ead015a414cc3ba194f3222714905
msgid ""
"**Payload identification (负载辨识)** belongs to the **vendor-impedance** path "
"(Tianji / Rokae), not the MIT path. Details below."
msgstr "**负载辨识**属于**厂商阻抗**路径（天玑 / 珞石），不属于 MIT 路径。详见下文。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:50
#: 93e715df60e84641b74e58362646d3c7
msgid "Force control and compliance"
msgstr "力控与柔顺"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:52
#: 4e0668c4caed4f6fa9778ca330726e4e
msgid "MIT-mode force control (Panthera HT / ARX)"
msgstr "MIT 力控（Panthera HT / 方舟无限）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:54
#: b4198fc5684e4182a34a411287c234e2
msgid ""
"Use this path on **Panthera HT** and **ARX** arms. The hardware interface "
"must run a **force-capable** MIT configuration; the controller then tracks "
"VR poses with that mix of position / velocity / effort."
msgstr ""
"在 **Panthera HT** 和 **方舟无限** 机械臂上走这条路径。硬件接口必须运行**带力控**的 MIT 配置；控制器再用位置 / 速度 "
"/ 力矩的组合跟踪 VR 位姿。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:56
#: 48000398df444d70afd5a92f84033c48
msgid ""
"**HighTorque Panthera HT** — [ht-ros2-control "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ht-"
"ros2-control/blob/main/README.md):"
msgstr ""
"**高擎 Panthera HT** — [ht-ros2-control README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ht-ros2-control/blob/main/README.md)："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:58
#: e691f70ef72f458184f15ae58c960861
msgid ""
"HI `control_mode:=mit` (default; older name `full_control` still accepted)"
msgstr "HI `control_mode:=mit`（默认；旧名 `full_control` 仍可用）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:59
#: 4dc8e4e3745a45d5a8d09deeb2368076
msgid ""
"The driver sends position + velocity + effort + kp/kd (`pos_vel_tqe_kp_kd`)"
msgstr "驱动下发位置 + 速度 + 力矩 + kp/kd（`pos_vel_tqe_kp_kd`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:60
#: 5f1d86447b5a485691cf56a8941f0d28
msgid ""
"Stiffness is HI parameters `joint_kp` / `joint_kd` (rqt / `ros2 param`), "
"**not** kp/kd command interfaces"
msgstr ""
"刚度是 HI 参数 `joint_kp` / `joint_kd`（rqt / `ros2 param`），**不是** kp/kd 命令接口"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:61
#: cbb2dc2448c647b49521dbcd74105a33
msgid ""
"Other documented HI modes: `effort` (torque only), `position` (position "
"only)"
msgstr "文档中的其他 HI 模式：`effort`（仅力矩）、`position`（仅位置）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:63
#: d71ceaa3f846462288d47f6434d4f8ab
msgid ""
"**ARX arms** — [arx-ros2-control README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arx-ros2-control/blob/main/README.md):"
msgstr ""
"**方舟无限机械臂** — [arx-ros2-control README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arx-"
"ros2-control/blob/main/README.md)："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:65
#: 58a225d71eb14eb0b9e8a941d818aa4c
msgid ""
"Arms support only `full_control` / MIT MIX. Other `control_mode` values in "
"xacro are warned and ignored"
msgstr "机械臂只支持 `full_control` / MIT MIX。xacro 里写的其他 `control_mode` 会告警并被忽略"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:66
#: cea205bc7a3c4b389158640088628b26
msgid "`write()` always sends position + velocity + effort"
msgstr "`write()` 始终下发位置 + 速度 + 力矩"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:67
#: f274710bdce54d0ea838e8898fb367d7
msgid ""
"MIT `kp` / `kd` come from HI `joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains` (no kp/kd "
"command interface)"
msgstr ""
"MIT 的 `kp` / `kd` 来自 HI 的 `joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains`（没有 kp/kd 命令接口）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:68
#: f5d4bb6052bf41a6b37c766224294572
msgid ""
"README mapping: OCS2 trajectory → position; OCS2 `future_input` → velocity; "
"OCS2 effort → gravity / static feedforward torque"
msgstr ""
"README 映射：OCS2 轨迹 → 位置；OCS2 `future_input` → 速度；OCS2 力矩 → 重力 / 静力学前馈力矩"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:70
#: 157e19c1edad40c998448e5b1f72f110
msgid ""
"**Controller** — [ocs2_arm_controller README — Interface "
"Configuration](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/README.md):"
msgstr ""
"**控制器** — [ocs2_arm_controller README — Interface "
"Configuration](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/README.md)："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:72
#: 2a9c8f99702a4ecfbc604a867e555ddf
msgid ""
"Mode is **auto-detected** from the robot config (no extra launch flag named "
"`force:=`)"
msgstr "模式由机器人配置**自动检测**（没有名为 `force:=` 的额外 launch 参数）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:73
#: d6a453381bd44d3791a9eff37fb1dfe5
msgid "Position-only: command `position`; state `position` + `velocity`"
msgstr "仅位置：命令 `position`；状态 `position` + `velocity`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:74
#: 80d1ec3851fd434291809987f8f9d385
msgid ""
"Force / MIX: command `position`, `velocity`, `effort`, `kp`, `kd` all "
"present; YAML `force_gains` is `[kp, kd]`"
msgstr ""
"力控 / MIX：命令接口同时具备 `position`、`velocity`、`effort`、`kp`、`kd`；YAML "
"`force_gains` 为 `[kp, kd]`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:75
#: 7aa8ad5e5ee84619b50f9ca2a1a9d67a
msgid ""
"ARX documents OCS2 MIX as pos + vel + effort with kp/kd on the HI. HT notes "
"that when kp/kd are **not** command interfaces, OCS2 may stay in position "
"mode; gravity compensation then uses `ht_gravity_compensation` or larger "
"`joint_kp` (same HT README)"
msgstr ""
"方舟无限文档把 OCS2 MIX 写成位置 + 速度 + 力矩，kp/kd 在 HI 上。高擎说明：当 kp/kd **不是**命令接口时，OCS2 "
"可能停在位置模式；重力补偿改用 `ht_gravity_compensation` 或调大 `joint_kp`（同一份 HT README）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:77
#: 302e342766df4baea5389de55cac9bb8
msgid ""
"Bring the robot up with the lean-branch `./quick_start.sh` / "
"`hardware:=real` path on [HighTorque Panthera "
"HT](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md) or [ARX Lift "
"2S](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md), then start VR as "
"below."
msgstr ""
"先按精简分支的 `./quick_start.sh` / `hardware:=real` 拉起机器人：[高擎 Panthera "
"HT](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md) 或 [方舟无限 Lift "
"2S](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md)，再按下文启动 VR。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:79
#: f9470c8bf0d2479f8d0ac31a06fa7d50
msgid ""
"This MIT path is **not** isomorphic teleop. Master–slave `mode:=mit` / "
"`effort` on Panthera HT is [Isomorphic Teleop](7-isomorphic_teleop.md)."
msgstr ""
"这条 MIT 路径**不是**同构遥操作。Panthera HT 上主从 `mode:=mit` / `effort` "
"见[同构遥操作](7-isomorphic_teleop.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:81
#: 0e5d818c7db5471a83ae243a251f3db3
msgid "Vendor joint impedance (Tianji / Rokae)"
msgstr "厂商关节阻抗（天玑 / 珞石）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:83
#: d3ab9f510c7a42e88d7037864e7e60da
msgid ""
"Use this path on **Tianji** (天玑) and **Rokae** (珞石). The controller only "
"sends **joint position**. Joint impedance / compliance is the **vendor** "
"feature, switched on the hardware interface."
msgstr "在 **天玑** 和 **珞石** 上走这条路径。控制器只下发**关节位置**。关节阻抗 / 柔顺是**厂商**能力，在硬件接口上切换。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:85
#: 7f4b602d4bd14d10bb512a0ef34ef74c
msgid ""
"**Tianji** — [marvin-ros2-control README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/marvin-ros2-control/blob/master/README.md):"
msgstr ""
"**天玑** — [marvin-ros2-control README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/marvin-ros2-control/blob/master/README.md)："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:87
#: 09cdd1eac0854f66a9965b2bd2c645ff
msgid ""
"Command interfaces: joint **`position` only**. State: `position`, "
"`velocity`, `effort`"
msgstr "命令接口：关节 **仅 `position`**。状态：`position`、`velocity`、`effort`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:88
#: f146053882624688b3fef5af752e9897
msgid ""
"Runtime `ctrl_mode`: `POSITION` / `JOINT_IMPEDANCE` / `CART_IMPEDANCE` / "
"`POWER_OFF`"
msgstr ""
"运行时 `ctrl_mode`：`POSITION` / `JOINT_IMPEDANCE` / `CART_IMPEDANCE` / "
"`POWER_OFF`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:89
#: 5d765a1b77e040fa98a19e54b8b7f9fc
msgid ""
"Joint impedance gains: `joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains` (7 values). "
"Cartesian: `cart_k_gains` / `cart_d_gains`"
msgstr ""
"关节阻抗增益：`joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains`（7 维）。笛卡尔：`cart_k_gains` / "
"`cart_d_gains`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:90
#: 226fd9b6f70d482d84538c64c0d5fa5d
msgid "Example: `ros2 param set /<hardware_node> ctrl_mode JOINT_IMPEDANCE`"
msgstr "示例：`ros2 param set /<hardware_node> ctrl_mode JOINT_IMPEDANCE`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:92
#: 8f24793155404ba5820acb2a63de911f
msgid ""
"**Rokae** — same pattern (position commands; compliance in the vendor HI). "
"Parameter names are in the private `rokae-ros2-control` README after access."
" Overview: [Private hardware "
"interfaces](../../4-reference/hardware/2-private_hi.md)."
msgstr ""
"**珞石** — 同一模式（位置命令；柔顺在厂商 HI）。参数名在开通后的私有 `rokae-ros2-control` "
"README。概览：[私有硬件接口](../../4-reference/hardware/2-private_hi.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:94
#: f20a7868e3b04c12a54c2b638715eb50
msgid ""
"Internal FA robots that use Tianji / Rokae arms live in [fa-deploy-ws "
"Setup](../../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md). Extra robot IDs and "
"launch flags are in that workspace README after access."
msgstr ""
"使用天玑 / 珞石臂的内部 FA 机器人见 [fa-deploy-ws "
"配置](../../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md)。额外机器人 ID 和 launch 参数在开通后的该仓库 "
"README。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:96
#: bae43badc35741e090d0abfb726ff175
msgid "Payload identification (负载辨识)"
msgstr "负载辨识"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:98
#: 80b0cadbe0d2478eab28198065549190
msgid ""
"负载辨识 is **only** on the Tianji / Rokae (vendor impedance) path. It is not an"
" MIT / OCS2 `force_gains` procedure."
msgstr "负载辨识**只**在天玑 / 珞石（厂商阻抗）路径上。它不是 MIT / OCS2 `force_gains` 流程。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:100
#: d5d0566e4b2a47bab012d808d61e61ea
msgid ""
"**Public, verified Tianji wizard** (semi-automatic tool-dynamics ID on CCS):"
" [marvin-ros2-control "
"`scripts/tool_dyn_identify_wizard.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/marvin-ros2-control/blob/master/scripts/tool_dyn_identify_wizard.py), "
"installed as `ros2 run marvin_ros2_control tool_dyn_identify_wizard` "
"(`CMakeLists.txt` `install(PROGRAMS … RENAME tool_dyn_identify_wizard)`)."
msgstr ""
"**已核实的公开天玑向导**（CCS 上半自动工具动力学辨识）：[marvin-ros2-control "
"`scripts/tool_dyn_identify_wizard.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/marvin-"
"ros2-control/blob/master/scripts/tool_dyn_identify_wizard.py)，安装后为 `ros2 run"
" marvin_ros2_control tool_dyn_identify_wizard`（`CMakeLists.txt` 的 "
"`install(PROGRAMS … RENAME tool_dyn_identify_wizard)`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:102
#: a2f9d14cc6364151bb1b27ede31d60ec
msgid ""
"The wizard banner is **机械臂负载辨识向导（工具动力学参数辨识 / CCS）**. It connects to the "
"Marvin controller IP, collects no-load then loaded PVT trajectories, and "
"prints 10-D tool dynamics (`m, mx, my, mz, ixx, …`). Those values match HI "
"parameters `left_dyn_param` / `right_dyn_param` on the same README."
msgstr ""
"向导标题是**机械臂负载辨识向导（工具动力学参数辨识 / CCS）**。它连接 Marvin 控制器 IP，先采空载再采带载 PVT 轨迹，并打印 10"
" 维工具动力学（`m, mx, my, mz, ixx, …`）。这些值对应同一 README 里的 HI 参数 `left_dyn_param` / "
"`right_dyn_param`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:104
#: fa79cf666d1e46d98c7d2317da686616
msgid ""
"There is **no** public `open-deploy-ws` payload-ID flow. Internal on-site "
"Tianji payload identification is in the private **fa-deploy-ws** README "
"after access (default branch is typically `fa-w2`). Use that README’s script"
" names — they are not listed here."
msgstr ""
"公开的 `open-deploy-ws` **没有**负载辨识流程。内部现场天玑负载辨识在开通后的私有 **fa-deploy-ws** "
"README（默认分支通常是 `fa-w2`）。脚本名以该 README 为准，这里不列出。"

