#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:211
#: 9003930443874af9a52e0fc87604dbc7
msgid "Use workspace limits in software"
msgstr "在软件中使用工作空间限位"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:214
