msgid "Network Setup"
msgstr "网络设置"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:216
#: 21121abe36284e3d89ad8007b3b6e4cd
msgid ""
"The headset and the ROS 2 PC must be on a reachable network (same Domain ID;"
" Zenoh or DDS as needed)."
msgstr "头显与 ROS 2 主机必须处于可达网络（相同 Domain ID；按需使用 Zenoh 或 DDS）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:218
#: 415ded1af944457781d1a7c3af401f6f
msgid ""
"**Pico Enterprise:** USB shared networking (USB 网络共享) is supported — tether "
"the headset to the PC over USB so they share a network. Follow the headset’s"
" own USB-network UI; this page does not list ADB or `usb0` commands."
msgstr ""
"**Pico 企业版：** 支持 USB 网络共享 — 用 USB 将头显连接到电脑以共享网络。按头显自带的 USB 网络界面操作；本页不列出 ADB "
"或 `usb0` 命令。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:219
#: 839aba8742e54e799fd74fe77d76ad02
msgid ""
"**Pico consumer / Meta Quest:** use the usual Wi-Fi (or other IP) path. Do "
"not assume USB 网络共享."
msgstr "**Pico 消费版 / Meta Quest：** 使用常规 Wi-Fi（或其他 IP）路径。不要假定有 USB 网络共享。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:221
